  language in the FAQ change we have seen  them update this occasionally at times  just a couple of words changing and then  at other times completely new questions  getting added so I am very curious to  see if they will drop that companion  language eventually and use something  else because they have both relationship  and companion all there in that same  answer now there is one more key angle  to consider here regarding the trophies  I am not going to talk about it just yet  this is your spoiler warning I know some  people do not want to know about any of  the trophies at all I consider this a  minor spoiler but if you don't want to  know anything about the trophies now is  your time to click off okay so minor  story spoilers here what I think is very  interesting about the trophy list is  they do not mention companions instead  there are three specific trophies or  achievements for poppy Sweeting Nats  ionai and Sebastian sallow and they all  say complete their relationship line so  this is actually further evidence for me  that I think Hogwarts Legacy is just  completely dropping this companionship  language now you may be asking what  about Amit is Amit on there no he is not  now if you're Ravenclaw and hearing that  on the trophies makes you worry don't  worry because I think there are so many  other trophies here that omit could  definitely be involved with and then in  a game as big as this guy's not every  Quest is going to have its own specific  trophy that's just not going to happen  there's nothing on here about Lucan  there's nothing on here about Zenobia  however there is one for Imelda and the  broom races so I mean we already have a  confirmed relationship Quest because we  saw it in the gameplay Showcase with  Lucan however that one is not in the  trophy list but how do all of you out  there feel about a mitt do you feel he  is a step below the other companions  that we've learned about so far is he  somewhere in between people like Lucan  and natsai or once we play the game are  we going to be able to see that they all  have their own fully fleshed out stories  and sure maybe some end up being more  important than others leave a comment  below to let me know now that bit about  the relationships was certainly not the  only thing revealed in this gameplay  Showcase in fact we had some big time  reveals and I've already made a video  breaking down what I think are the 20  biggest pieces of new information to  come out from that check it out on the  right side of your screen now as always  thank you all so much for watching I'll  talk to you again soon
 

